# Touch interaction

Sources: `packages/web/src/shared/lib/touch.ts`, `gestures.ts`, and `packages/web/src/app/app.styles.css`.

- Prefer Pointer Events and existing gesture hooks; support hybrid mouse/touch devices rather than inferring permanently from screen width.
- Keep primary actions usable without hover. Touch and pointer context menus should reach the same operation.
- Preserve document zoom, scrolling, and selection. Scope `touch-action` and non-passive listeners only where the gesture needs them.
- Check tap targets, virtual keyboard, and safe-area insets in the affected view; CSS helpers do not prove every custom control is accessible.
- Verify cancellation when movement becomes scrolling and dispose listeners with the owner. Report device/emulation validation limits.
